<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AMC said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AMC said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co cut AMC Entertainment Inc to market perform from outperform, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down one at 16-7/8.</p>
</text>
